  "bodyHash": "aeb22eec121a1689",
  "content": "<p>此模组添加了四种具有不同力量、速度和效果的元素剑：火剑、水剑、风剑和土剑。</p>\n<p>以及一把特殊的剑：神之剑。</p>\n<p>该模组兼容：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></p>\n<p>这些剑允许你通过右键点击激活不同的强力效果。你可以按住“Shift”键并使用剑来查看它提供的力量详情。</p>\n<p>你可以使用同类型的其他剑或在工作台上使用制作该剑的材料来修复你的剑。</p>\n<p>你可以附魔这把剑。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置文件：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>从<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/four-elemental-swords/files/4935790\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElementalSwords-1.20.2-2.7.5-[FORGE]</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/four-elemental-swords/files/4935793\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElementalSwords-1.20.2-1.7.8-[FABRIC]</a>开始，有一个配置文件（elemental-sword-parameters.toml）用于处理和修改剑的参数（伤害、攻击速度和耐久度）。此外，在此配置文件中添加了“elemental-swords-effects.toml”，用于修改效果的持续时间。</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">对于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/four-elemental-swords/files/4326188\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElementalSwords-1.18.2-2.5.9-[FORGE]</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/four-elemental-swords/files/4327349\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElementalSwords-1.19.2-2.6.9-[FORGE]</a>，有一个配置文件（elemental-swords-effects.toml）用于停用或启用各种武器效果并更改这些效果的等级。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">从<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/four-elemental-swords/files/3598450\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElementalSwords-1.18.1-2.5.5-[FORGE]</a>开始，有一个配置文件（elemental-swords-config.toml）用于停用或启用剑（默认全部启用）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">从<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/four-elemental-swords/files/3661471\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElementalSwords-1.18.1-2.5.6-[FORGE]</a>开始，你可以在配置文件中选择使用钻石剑还是下界合金剑进行合成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">从<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/four-elemental-swords/files/3666256\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElementalSwords-1.18.1-1.6.0-[FABRIC]</a>开始，有一个配置文件，具有与Forge版本相同的功能。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>添加了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterCombat</a>（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daedelus_dev\" rel=\"nofollow\">daedelus_dev</a>）的兼容性：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>从<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/four-elemental-swords/files/4000677\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElementalSwords-1.19.2-2.6.7-[FORGE]</a>开始</li>\n<li>从<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/four-elemental-swords/files/4000708\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElementalSwords-1.19.2-1.7.4-[FABRIC]</a>开始</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/BlackWolf00/Elemental-Swords-Public\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>如果你想帮我翻译成不同的语言：<a href=\"https://github.com/BlackWolf00/Elemental-Swords-Public\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/BlackWolf00/Elemental-Swords-Public</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lauchering/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">lauchering </a>对模组的评论：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fNKJpz7jzL0c\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/NKJpz7jzL0c;</a></p>\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/misterecho/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">MisterEcho </a>对模组的评论：<a rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/NqmCVMUENRs\"&amp;gt;https://youtu.be/NqmCVMUENR</a>;</p>\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/escanorblock/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">EscanorBlock</a> 对模组的评论：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252ftxIWaAgYM38%253ft%253d522\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/txIWaAgYM38?t=522</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>欢迎在你的整合包中使用此模组</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>火剑&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">(给予玩家火焰抗性并使敌人着火)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">攻击力: 10 速度: 2.6</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M27MWMu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"148\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>风剑&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">(给予玩家最大等级的跳跃提升、最大等级的加速和缓慢降落)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">攻击力: 8 速度: 3.9</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TwBofHs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"146\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>水剑&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">(给予玩家最大等级的潮涌能量、最大等级的海豚恩惠和最大等级水下呼吸)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">攻击力: 9 速度: 3.1</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/irQaGrB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>土剑&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">(给予玩家吸收III、抗性提升III和力量III)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">攻击力: 14 速度: 1.6</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B9UnDPy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"146\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>神之剑&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">(给予玩家不同的强力效果)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">攻击力: 24 速度: 3.4</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eoJM9lB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"146\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?r